00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:27,600
24 Hour Party People is a comedy, drama, music film
directed by Michael Winterbottom.

3
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:08,400
Manchester, 1976.

4
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:49,200
Tony Wilson is an ambitious but frustrated local TV news
reporter looking for a way to make his mark.

5
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:30,000
After witnessing a life-changing concert by a band known as the Sex Pistols, he persuades his station to televise
one of their performances, and soon Manchester's punk groups are clamoring for him to manage them.

6
00:28:04,800 --> 00:28:10,800
Riding the wave of a musical revolution, Wilson and his friends create
the legendary Factory Records label and The Hacienda club.

7
